{"title": "Hammer and shooting star", "type": "Technical lesson", "hooks": ["Stop trading every hammer. Check where it formed first.", "Two candles warn you a move is running out of steam.", "Two candles, one rule: location first."], "scenes": [{"kind": "hook", "vo": "Stop trading every hammer. Check where it formed first.", "text": "Location first", "chart": 0, "win": [20, 115], "show": 90}, {"kind": "chart", "chart": 0, "head": "The hammer", "show": 60, "vo": "The hammer: a long lower wick, a small body near the top. After a fall, sellers pushed down, but buyers fought back.", "cues": [{"say": "The hammer", "do": "zoom", "from": 44, "to": 60}, {"say": "a long lower wick", "do": "mark", "i": 53, "label": "H", "side": "low", "tone": "green"}], "win": [20, 115]}, {"kind": "chart", "chart": 0, "head": "The shooting star", "show": 89, "vo": "The shooting star is the opposite. A long upper wick, a small body near the bottom. After a rise, sellers pushed back.", "cues": [{"say": "shooting star", "do": "zoom", "from": 78, "to": 92}, {"say": "A long upper wick", "do": "mark", "i": 89, "label": "S", "side": "high", "tone": "red"}], "win": [20, 115]}, {"kind": "chart", "chart": 0, "head": "Location matters", "vo": "But this star formed below resistance, in the middle of nowhere. The next candle went straight up into the level.", "cues": [{"say": "below resistance", "do": "line", "price": 31.76, "label": "Resistance", "tone": "amber"}, {"say": "The next candle", "do": "reveal", "to": 90}], "win": [20, 115], "show": 89}, {"kind": "big", "text": "Location, then confirmation", "vo": "At support or resistance, they're worth noticing. Anywhere else, they're noise. And wait for the next candle to confirm.", "chart": null}, {"kind": "outro", "text": "Spot them yourself", "vo": "Practise spotting hammers and shooting stars on real game charts at memestreet.net.", "chart": null}], "caption": "Stop trading every hammer. Check where it formed first.\n\nThe hammer: a long lower wick and 